  "description": "The Four Seater Merry-Go-Round is a classic round platform with red and yellow seats for four children. It suits a wide age band, with a Key User Group of 3 to 9 years, so siblings of different ages can ride together. Older children often push the platform while younger ones sit, which makes this a social piece as much as a ride. The platform is 6'5\" in diameter and the safe play area is a 12'5\" circle. It is a dependable choice for a school, society or public garden that wants one merry-go-round for many children. Colours are multi colour. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe and roto-moulded seats, and bearings are covered for 1 year. Ask us for a quote and a site layout.",
