    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "The Four Seater Merry-Go-Round is a classic round platform with red and yellow seats for four children. It suits a wide age band, with a Key User Group of 3 to 9 years, so siblings of different ages can ride together. Older children often push the platform while younger ones sit, which makes this a social piece as much as a ride. The platform is 6'5\" in diameter and the safe play area is a 12'5\" circle. It is a dependable choice for a school, society or public garden that wants one merry-go-round for many children. Colours are multi colour. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe and roto-moulded seats, and bearings are covered for 1 year. Ask us for a quote and a site layout."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "ProductSpecifications5",
   "props": {
    "pText": "The Four Seater is built on a galvanised steel frame with roto-moulded seats and a central bearing. On site, we fix it self-standing or by grouting. Children run around the platform to push it, so keep the full 12'5\" circle clear and level, and grease or check the bearing as part of routine maintenance.",
